    {
      "text": "# DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash-1017",
      "url": "https://huggingface.co/deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash-1017",
      "publisher": "Hugging Face · deepseek-ai"
    },
    {
      "text": "**DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash-1017** is a minor update to [**DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash**](https://huggingface.co/deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash), delivering substantial improvements across reasoning, coding, agentic tasks, and visual benchmarks.",
